<!--
  Water depth: "above". The container is the water body and the wave line is the level, so the six
  depth icons differ only in how full they are. That is honest - the app has no sensor and no
  calibration, so the icon shows an ordinal position, never a measurement - and it reads at a glance
  at 26dp, which a detailed pictogram would not.
-->
